flowchart TD
    InstallStart([生命周期入口]) --> InstallRecovery[执行公共 journal 检查/修复；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    InstallRecovery -->|成功；锁保持| InstallCommand[进入当前命令]

    InstallCommand --> InstallDiscovery[执行公共 Agent 刷新流程；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    InstallDiscovery -->|成功；锁保持| InstallTarget{具体目标在快照中，或 all 快照非空?}
    InstallTarget -->|否| InstallTargetFail[打印目标 Agent 未受支持或未安装，或没有已支持且已安装的 Agent] --> InstallPreflightFail
    InstallTarget -->|是| InstallResolve[解析 power 与可选 version；获取云端元数据；省略 type 从云端元数据推断；省略 version 选云端最新；显式版本允许升级或降级]
    InstallResolve -->|失败| InstallPreflightFail[记录预执行失败；全部目标 Agent 标记 unexecuted] --> InstallPrintFailureSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> InstallBatchError([停止剩余 Agent；释放锁；非零退出])
    InstallResolve -->|成功| InstallNextAgent{按快照中已支持且已安装 Agent ID 升序还有目标 Agent?}
    InstallNextAgent -->|否| InstallPrintSuccessSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> InstallOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    InstallNextAgent -->|是| InstallAdapter["Resolve(currentAgent, type) 解析当前 Agent Adapter"]
    InstallAdapter -->|失败| InstallFail[记录当前 Agent failed；其余按确定顺序标记 unexecuted]
    InstallAdapter -->|成功| InstallReadManifest[读取当前 Agent 安装清单]
    InstallReadManifest -->|失败| InstallFail
    InstallReadManifest -->|成功| InstallSame{已安装目标版本?}
    InstallSame -->|是| InstallSkip[打印相同版本，记录当前 Agent completed] --> InstallNextAgent

    subgraph InstallPreCommit["提交点前事务阶段（失败时回滚）"]
        InstallSame -->|否| InstallCreateJournal[创建 install journal]
        InstallCreateJournal -->|失败| InstallFail
        InstallCreateJournal -->|成功| InstallCache[校验缓存；缺失则临时下载、校验并原子入缓存]
        InstallCache -->|失败| InstallRollback[提交点前回滚临时文件、staging 与旧版本]
        InstallCache -->|成功| InstallStage[在 staging 中转换并准备安装内容]
        InstallStage -->|失败| InstallRollback
        InstallStage -->|成功| InstallExisting{存在旧版本?}
        InstallExisting -->|是| InstallBackup[原子移动旧版本到事务备份]
        InstallBackup -->|失败| InstallRollback
        InstallExisting -->|否| InstallIntent[持久化 publishing 意图]
        InstallBackup -->|成功| InstallIntent
        InstallIntent -->|失败| InstallRollback
        InstallIntent -->|成功| InstallPublish[[原子 rename staging 到正式路径：提交点]]
        InstallPublish -->|未越过提交点| InstallRollback
        InstallRollback --> InstallRollbackOK{回滚成功?}
        InstallRollbackOK -->|是| InstallRolledBack[删除 journal；打印回滚内容]
        InstallRollbackOK -->|否| InstallKeepRollback[保留 journal；打印回滚失败]
    end

    subgraph InstallPostCommit["提交点后事务阶段（失败时保留 journal，由下次预检完成提交）"]
        InstallPublish -->|已越过提交点| InstallManifest[原子更新安装清单]
        InstallManifest -->|失败| InstallKeepCommit[保留 journal；打印清单更新失败]
        InstallManifest -->|成功| InstallCleanup[清理备份与临时文件；最后删除 journal]
        InstallCleanup -->|失败| InstallKeepCommit
        InstallCleanup -->|成功| InstallInstalled[打印首次安装、升级或降级成功；记录当前 Agent completed]
    end

    InstallInstalled --> InstallNextAgent
    InstallRolledBack --> InstallFail
    InstallKeepRollback --> InstallFail
    InstallKeepCommit --> InstallFail
    InstallFail --> InstallPrintFailureSummary

    InstallResolve -.进程中断.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallAdapter -.进程中断.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallReadManifest -.进程中断.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallCreateJournal -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallCache -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallStage -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallBackup -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallIntent -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallPublish -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallManifest -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallCleanup -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallRollback -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallRolledBack -.清理 journal 时中断；保留 journal.-> InstallInterrupted

    style InstallPreCommit fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    style InstallPostCommit fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
